# Conditional choices
@scenario tutorial_lesson_31
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[stage clear]
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set tutorial_source scripts/tutorial/31_gated_choices.vns]
[set tutorial_excerpt options]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
[set lab_pass false]
ginger: The archive has a locked door. Check the options, borrow a pass and come back. The same VNS choice block responds to the new state.
@label lab
# region options
> Borrow a pass -> borrow
> Enter the archive -> enter [if lab_pass]
> Return the pass -> surrender [if lab_pass]
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Practice exercise -> practice
> Review question -> check
# endregion
@label borrow
[flag lab_pass]
ginger: A pass changes one variable. See which choices appear.
[jump lab]
@label surrender
[unflag lab_pass]
ginger: The flag is false. The conditional choices should disappear again.
[jump lab]
@label enter
ginger: You reached the archive. Edit the condition on Enter and replay both cases. Keep Borrow unconditional so the player always has a way forward.
[jump lab]
@label return_hub
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[if !tutorial_done_31]
[flag tutorial_done_31]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_7]
[end]

@label practice
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: Borrow and return the pass without changing the script. Which entry must remain available?
> Enter the archive before borrowing. -> practice_hint
> Borrow a pass at the initial state. -> practice_result
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label practice_hint
ginger: An unconditional Borrow route makes the locked state navigable.
[jump practice]
@label practice_result
ginger: An unconditional Borrow route makes the locked state navigable.
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
> Review question -> check
> Try the interactive lab again -> start
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: The pass is false. Should the archive choice be visible?
> No, its condition is false. -> correct
> Yes, the target label exists. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: Visibility comes from the condition, even when the label exists.
[jump check]
@label correct
ginger: Visibility comes from the condition, even when the label exists.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
